Package: stats4ROI
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Analysis for Return on Investment - Refactored
Version: 4.0.0
Authors@R: person("Your Name", "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Description: A comprehensive statistical analysis application for ROI calculations. 
    This is a complete refactored version of the original stats4ROI application, 
    transformed from a 40,000+ line monolithic codebase into a modern, maintainable, 
    and extensible modular application. It provides a friendly graphic front end 
    to access powerful statistical program R without requiring knowledge of R scripting.
